  "boundaries": [
    "API RowDelete carries snapshot-local live ordinal and exact ordinary record payload (column count through final mask), excluding page/slot metadata. Duplicate/missing/stale requests refuse.",
    "Feature ace16-write-preview only; Ace16DeletePreview has original/candidate bytes and deleted_rows, no journal/apply/qualified-plan conversion. Source bytes never written.",
    "Existing structural/property/active-content/history/constraint and ignored-NULL gates remain. Any relationship touching the table refuses even for empty requests; no cascades or delete actions skipped.",
    "Actual checked slot words receive existing DELETED|RELOCATED bits, with payload offsets unchanged. Full logical definition validation resolves first-page live-count bytes through owning layout constant.",
    "Genuine Change::Delete reuses existing WriteProfile dispatcher/codecs and physical-alias deduplication. All physical indexes must qualify, even empty requests. Root-only leaf/link/stamp/height guard; no nodes/allocation/splits/merges or Text/Binary mutation.",
    "Historical index counters and all outside-allowlist bytes stay unchanged. Index entries removed by exact row reference, retained order/ties preserved; empty roots repacked with zero prefix and boundaries.",
    "New structural patch trigger forces full postchecks for unindexed tombstones; default hook preserves all prior mask-update behavior.",
    "Shared preview::qualify now enforces documented plain subversion0 admission for all engineering preview APIs. Reads retain plain1 recognition; normal ACE write eligibility unchanged.",
    "Unit/property and Jackcess/reference observations are not native Microsoft Access save/reopen, data-macro absence/execution, durable commit or shared-file qualification.",
    "Original candidate/getter replay is separate and not counted here; originals remain immutable."
  ]
